  <section class="access-shell">
    <div class="access-story">
      <div class="story-brand"><img src="images/logo/logo.webp" alt="KJA"><span>Portal del equipo</span></div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Tu jornada, en un solo lugar</p>
        <h1>Empieza el día<br>con claridad.</h1>
        <p>Consulta tu horario, registra tu asistencia y sigue tu avance sin buscar enlaces ni enviar capturas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-features" aria-hidden="true">
        <p>Dentro de tu portal</p>
        <div class="story-feature-grid">
          <span class="story-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18"/></svg>
            <span><small>Consulta</small><b>Tu horario</b></span>
          </span>
          <span class="story-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3 7-7"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-5.3-8.2"/></svg>
            <span><small>Registra</small><b>Tu asistencia</b></span>
          </span>
          <span class="story-feature">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V9M10 19V5M16 19v-7M22 19H2"/></svg>
            <span><small>Revisa</small><b>Tu avance</b></span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="access-form-wrap">
      <div class="access-form-head">
        <span class="mobile-logo"><img src="images/logo/kja.webp" alt="KJA"></span>
        <p class="eyebrow">Acceso seguro</p>
        <h2>Ingresa a tu portal</h2>
        <p>Usa los mismos datos con los que marcas asistencia.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="login-panel">
        <div class="login-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Tipo de acceso">
          <button class="active" id="tab-colab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="form-colab">Colaborador</button>
          <button id="tab-admin" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="form-admin">Dirección</button>
        </div>

      <form id="form-colab" class="login-form" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-colab">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="dni">DNI</label>
          <div class="field-box">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="11" r="2"/><path d="M5.5 16c.7-1.7 4.3-1.7 5 0M14 9h4M14 13h4"/></svg>
            <input id="dni" name="dni" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="username" maxlength="8" placeholder="8 dígitos" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="pin">PIN de asistencia</label>
          <div class="field-box">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>
            <input id="pin" name="pin" type="password" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="4" placeholder="••••" required>
            <button class="reveal" type="button" data-reveal="pin" aria-label="Mostrar PIN"><span>Ver</span><svg class="eye-open" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 12s3.5-6 9.5-6 9.5 6 9.5 6-3.5 6-9.5 6-9.5-6-9.5-6Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.8"/></svg><svg class="eye-closed" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 3 18 18M10.6 6.2A10.8 10.8 0 0 1 12 6c6 0 9.5 6 9.5 6a16 16 0 0 1-2.2 3M6.2 6.2A15.7 15.7 0 0 0 2.5 12s3.5 6 9.5 6c1 0 2-.2 2.9-.5M9.9 9.9a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 4.2"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-msg" id="colab-msg" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></div>
        <button class="primary" id="btn-colab" type="submit"><span>Entrar a mi portal</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
        <p class="form-note">¿Aún no tienes PIN? Por esta primera etapa puedes crearlo desde el enlace de marcado que comparte Dirección.</p>
      </form>

      <form id="form-admin" class="login-form" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-admin" hidden>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="admin-email">Correo administrativo</label>
          <div class="field-box">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16v12H4zM4 7l8 6 8-6"/></svg>
            <input id="admin-email" type="email" autocomplete="username" placeholder="nombre@correo.com" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="admin-pass">Contraseña</label>
          <div class="field-box">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>
            <input id="admin-pass" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Tu contraseña" required>
            <button class="reveal" type="button" data-reveal="admin-pass" aria-label="Mostrar contraseña"><span>Ver</span><svg class="eye-open" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 12s3.5-6 9.5-6 9.5 6 9.5 6-3.5 6-9.5 6-9.5-6-9.5-6Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.8"/></svg><svg class="eye-closed" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 3 18 18M10.6 6.2A10.8 10.8 0 0 1 12 6c6 0 9.5 6 9.5 6a16 16 0 0 1-2.2 3M6.2 6.2A15.7 15.7 0 0 0 2.5 12s3.5 6 9.5 6c1 0 2-.2 2.9-.5M9.9 9.9a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 4.2"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-msg" id="admin-msg" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></div>
        <button class="primary" id="btn-admin" type="submit"><span>Ingresar como Dirección</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

